flowchart LR
  ID[Identity]-->PORT[Portfolio]
  PORT-->LED[Ledger: AccountingCommand only]
  PAY[Payment Evidence]-->REC[Reconciliation]
  WD[Withdrawal Evidence]-->REC
  MD[Market Data]-->STR[Strategy]
  AI[AI Orchestrator]-->STR
  STR-->RISK[Risk/Policy/Compliance/Fraud]
  RISK-->SIM[Simulation]
  SIM-->GUARD[Transaction Guard]
  GUARD-->EXEC[Execution]
  EXEC-->REC
  REC-->CP[Correction Proposal]
  CP-->AA[Accounting Authority]
  AA-->AC[Authorized AccountingCommand]
  AC-->LED
  AUD[Audit]---ID
  AUD---EXEC
  AUD---AA
